      "message": "Interesting question: What should we do if these reads fail?  And should we try to read as much as we can?\n\nIt might be better to do something like:\n\n\trv \u003d EC_SUCCESS;\n\n\tif (flash_physical_info_read_word(INFO_BOARD_ID_TYPE_OFFSET,\n\t\t\t\t\t   \u0026id-\u003etype)) {\n\t\tid-\u003etype \u003d 0;\n\t\trv \u003d EC_ERROR_UNKNOWN;\n\n\t(same for other 2 checks)\n\n\treturn rv;",
