      "writtenOn": "2017-05-26T00:07:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then here, we can explicitly ignore failures of read_board_id(), because we know any failures will result in that field being read as 0.\n\nA header which isn\u0027t BoardID-locked should still work even if we can\u0027t read BoardID.  And any BoardID-locked header should fail if a field it cares about is 0.",
